{"counts":{"canonical":22,"context":0,"total":22,"unknown_date":0,"unlinked":0},"events":[{"aliases":["Archaeological Site of Mehrgarh","泥砖","聚落"],"body":[],"categories":["科技","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-bf2f7311a77f802426eb3684","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-bf2f7311a77f802426eb3684","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-5772d60dd6f8b81bb35ec734","summary":"梅赫尔格尔位于今巴基斯坦俾路支省的卡奇平原，靠近博兰山口和博兰河。这里保存了跨公元前第七至第三千纪的长期考古序列，地层深逾十一米。多代居民反复营建泥砖建筑，旧屋遗存被新建筑覆盖，逐渐累积成今天看到的聚落土丘。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前第七至第三千纪","end_year":-2001,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-7000},"title":"梅赫尔格尔群体连续营建泥砖聚落"},{"aliases":["Chinchorro","丧葬","遗体处理"],"body":[],"categories":["宗教","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["钦乔罗文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-6abcf6ce3331b30f63ffec6d","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-6abcf6ce3331b30f63ffec6d","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-5497db2bba26e3b36f16fc2b","summary":"钦乔罗文化的海洋狩猎采集群体，约在公元前5450至前890年生活于今智利北部干旱的阿塔卡马沿海。海洋资源是其生计的重要基础，遗址中发现用骨、贝壳以及矿物和植物材料制作的工具，也保存了格外复杂的葬俗证据。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前5450—前890年","end_year":-890,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-5450},"title":"钦乔罗海洋采集群体发展人工木乃伊葬俗"},{"aliases":["Kitakogane Site","渔业","贝丘","居住"],"body":[],"categories":["文化","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["绳纹文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-4ef0cd76f93ea5148e1ddd8f","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-4ef0cd76f93ea5148e1ddd8f","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-ed76ae8247c548adbfb267a6","summary":"北黄金遗址位于北海道西南部内浦湾东岸的台地，考古范围约从公元前5000年延续至前2000年。聚落包含竖穴住居、墓葬、贝丘和用水地点。大量贝壳、鱼骨与海兽骨表明，当地居民充分利用沿海水域，以捕鱼和其他海洋资源获取为重要生计。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前5000—前2000年","end_year":-2000,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-5000},"title":"北黄金居民以渔业为重要生计并营建聚落"},{"aliases":["Prehistoric Pile Dwellings around the Alps","居住建筑","环境利用"],"body":[],"categories":["科技","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-a536f3f65d5c123aab2dee06","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-a536f3f65d5c123aab2dee06","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-843c3d0b25516b22aa225af7","summary":"约公元前5000至前500年，阿尔卑斯及周边人群在湖岸、河边和湿地附近营建桩上聚落。列入世界遗产的系列包含多个国家的一百余处遗址，记录了新石器时代至青铜时代不同群体的居住方式。它们不是一座持续存在的城市，而是一组跨越漫长时期的聚落材料。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前5000—前500年","end_year":-500,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-5000},"title":"阿尔卑斯周边群体营建水边桩上聚落"},{"aliases":["Megalithic Temples of Malta","巨石建筑"],"body":[],"categories":["宗教","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-7c00599f2172bee57df0df8f","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-7c00599f2172bee57df0df8f","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-3c2e3ca3b2fa74f46abc623c","summary":"公元前第四至第三千纪，马耳他及戈佐岛的建造者用本地石材营建巨石庙。建筑常由立起的石板、上部横石、铺地庭院及沿中轴两侧展开的半圆形房间组成，各处平面与构造又有所不同。这些遗存表明，建造者能够根据石材性质和空间需求安排大型结构。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前第四至第三千纪","end_year":-2001,"kind":"dating_range","precision":"period","start_year":-4000},"title":"马耳他建造者以本地石材营建巨石庙"},{"aliases":["Stonehenge, Avebury and Associated Sites","巨石建筑","葬俗"],"body":[],"categories":["宗教","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-43cecb4a48bf8b2c4103592d","images":[{"caption":"巨石阵现存遗迹，Diego Delso于2014年摄影。","creator":"Diego Delso","credit":"Diego Delso / Wikimedia Commons / CC BY-SA 4.0","depiction_type":"modern_site_photograph","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","obligations":["保留作者、来源和许可证链接。","如改编图像，注明修改并以相同或兼容许可分享改编图像。","不对图像另加与本许可冲突的使用限制。"],"rights_revision_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=File%3AStonehenge%2C+Condado+de+Wiltshire%2C+Inglaterra%2C+2014-08-12%2C+DD+09.JPG&oldid=1285433761","sha256":"d2c6f7394b6cc04109e8a8eaa0ad1e0061c239f3897b25da545d11f93386375f","source_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Stonehenge,_Condado_de_Wiltshire,_Inglaterra,_2014-08-12,_DD_09.JPG","src":"/api/history/assets/AS-d2c6f7394b6cc04109e8a8eaa0ad1e0061c239f3897b25da545d11f93386375f.jpg"}],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-43cecb4a48bf8b2c4103592d","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-2a8e8317c58e269b1e5f1be8","summary":"约公元前3700至前1600年，今英国威尔特郡的巨石阵、埃夫伯里及周边地区持续营建和使用仪式性景观。这里不只有著名石圈，还包括大道、围沟、木构遗迹和多种墓葬。石材与土方建筑之间的位置关系，显示不同世代不断改变并重新利用同一地区。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前3700—前1600年","end_year":-1600,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-3700},"title":"巨石阵与埃夫伯里地区营建并使用仪式景观"},{"aliases":["来源未给独立事件专名；据所列遗址、器物或行动描述拟题。","聚落","台湾史前史"],"body":[],"categories":["文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-5d81c6ee9b97692db3883faa","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-5d81c6ee9b97692db3883faa","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-48e275a7bcc0d9c06c69b528","summary":"约公元前3500至前2000年，台湾新石器时代的聚落数量和规模出现明显变化。所引研究汇集淡水河流域、台湾东部及其他地区的遗址资料，指出一些地方从早期少数聚落发展到中期数十处聚落，部分中期遗址的面积也远大于早期遗址。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前3500—前2000年","end_year":-2000,"kind":"duration","precision":"year_range","start_year":-3500},"title":"台湾新石器时代的人口扩展阶段"},{"aliases":["Qixingdun site","城市","聚落布局"],"body":[],"categories":["文化","政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-b9da2308f0bbdf753bfd08e0","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-b9da2308f0bbdf753bfd08e0","record_type":"site","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-0acaf65263ef2c7ca99d222b","summary":"七星墩遗址位于湖南，约公元前3000至前2000年的材料保存了一处双层史前城址。外层大体呈圆形，内层近于矩形，城内外还留下房屋、陶窑、墓葬和灰坑等遗迹。这种布局为认识长江中游南缘聚落的营建及不同区域用途提供了重要线索。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前3000—前2000年","end_year":-2000,"kind":"duration","precision":"year_range","start_year":-3000},"title":"七星墩双层城址"},{"aliases":["Sacred City of Caral-Supe","城市","土石建筑"],"body":[],"categories":["文化","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["卡拉尔—苏佩文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-aaa0bbff63cfae1a4ee82317","images":[{"caption":"卡拉尔考古区的现存墙体及现代遮棚，2022年摄影。","creator":"Ariana zafra","credit":"Ariana zafra / Wikimedia Commons / CC BY-SA 4.0","depiction_type":"modern_site_photograph","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","obligations":["保留作者、来源和许可证链接。","如改编图像，注明修改并以相同或兼容许可分享改编图像。","不对图像另加与本许可冲突的使用限制。"],"rights_revision_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=File%3AHuaca+Caral+8.jpg&oldid=777607857","sha256":"342a3b7c9bfd21666608070e57db7ffe9c1d617b67467bf7b68a84c11bc2125f","source_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Huaca_Caral_8.jpg","src":"/api/history/assets/AS-342a3b7c9bfd21666608070e57db7ffe9c1d617b67467bf7b68a84c11bc2125f.jpg"}],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-aaa0bbff63cfae1a4ee82317","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-97e410832c6c350da457d88e","summary":"卡拉尔位于今秘鲁苏佩河谷旁的干旱台地，碳十四研究将其主要发展置于约公元前3000至前1800年。遗址中可见大型石土高台、下沉式圆形广场和居住建筑，建筑与开放空间相互组合，反映群体能够组织较大规模的公共营建。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前3000—前1800年","end_year":-1800,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-3000},"title":"卡拉尔群体营建高台与下沉式圆形广场"},{"aliases":["Dholavira: a Harappan City","水管理","城市"],"body":[],"categories":["科技","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["哈拉帕文明"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-6830125453e8b2be3b08e47b","images":[{"caption":"多拉维拉水管理、排水通道的现存遗迹，2022年摄影。","creator":"Prof Ranga Sai","credit":"Prof Ranga Sai / Wikimedia Commons / CC BY-SA 4.0","depiction_type":"modern_site_photograph","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","obligations":["保留作者、来源和许可证链接。","如改编图像，注明修改并以相同或兼容许可分享改编图像。","不对图像另加与本许可冲突的使用限制。"],"rights_revision_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=File%3AManholes+at+Dholavira+water+management+network.jpg&oldid=1223758466","sha256":"d3378781314189482ae79db296303fb91c03b188b0bde4e589d07d33eb87481e","source_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Manholes_at_Dholavira_water_management_network.jpg","src":"/api/history/assets/AS-d3378781314189482ae79db296303fb91c03b188b0bde4e589d07d33eb87481e.jpg"}],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-6830125453e8b2be3b08e47b","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-749abc2d3b0a0a310802e810","summary":"多拉维拉属于哈拉帕文明，位于今印度古吉拉特邦干旱的卡迪尔岛地，约在公元前3000至前1500年间有人居住。两条季节性溪